        "r": 291.38370000000003,
        "b": 604.0864492035388
      },
      "content": "This section describes the generator set preheat/ start/run control system.  The set may be started either at the onboard DC control box or by using a remotely mounted start control.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_144",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_3",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_3",
